      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks for these. can you expand a bit more on the force majeure part? specifically, i'm worried about how to define what counts as a 'bad faith' actor or someone trying to exploit loopholes in the contract during a shortage. how do we protect ourselves from people acting in bad faith?",
